WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.370
Welcome to GM.

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:09.438
A smarter digital experience, designed to bring
productivity, creativity, and technology together.

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:17.743
Discover a world of useful digital tools, intelligent
solutions, and innovative experiences, all in one place.

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:23.863
From everyday productivity to creative exploration,
GM makes digital possibilities simpler,

00:00:23.903 --> 00:00:25.813
